#odoo-require: zbsync
*** Settings ***
Library          OperatingSystem
Library          SeleniumLibrary
Documentation    Simple Pipeline Testing
Resource         ../../keywords/zync.robot
Test Setup       Setup Test

*** Variables ***

*** Keywords ***

*** Test Cases ***

Create a pipeline

    ## make csv file

    Goto Zync
    Screenshot
    Wait To Click    xpath=//button[@class='btn btn-primary o_list_button_add']    # [contains(@class, 'o_list_button_add')][1]
    WriteInField     name                                                          simple_pipe_test1_${TOKEN}
    FormSave

    Zync Add Worker    Demo-Data
    WriteInField       demo_count                     20
    Wait To Click      //button[@name='make_demo']
    Screenshot

    # make an instance
    Wait To Click      xpath=//button[@name = 'start_from_ui']
    ${instance_id}=    Get Instance ID From Url                   zbs.instance
    Screenshot

    Goto View                           zbs.pipeline                                                   ${instance_id}
    Odoo Button                         name=cronjobs
    Wait To Click                       //*[@name="cronjob_ids"]//a[contains(text(), "Add a line")]
    Wait Until Page Contains Element    xpath=//div//*[@name='Add: Cronjobs']
    Wait To Click                       //footer//button[text() = 'New']
    Wait Until Page Contains Element    //*[contains(text(), "Create Cronjobs")
    Write In Field                      name                                                           per second
    Wait To Click   //div[@name='cronjob_ids']//a[text() = 'Add a line']
    Write In Field     interval_type  Minutes  parent=cronjob_ids
    Wait To Click   //button[text() == 'Save & Close']


    ${started}=            Get Time    epoch
    ${timeout}=            900
    Odoo Start Cronjobs
    WHILE    ${TRUE}
        ${end_time}=           Get Time    epoch
        ${elapsed_seconds}=    Evaluate    ${end_time} - ${started}
        IF    ${elapsed_seconds} > ${timeout}
            FAIL    Timeout ${timeout} failed.
        END

        Wait Queuejobs Done
        ${state}=              Run Keyword And Return Status    Wait Until Element Is Visible    xpath=//div[@class='zbs-batch success']    timeout=10s
        IF    ${state}
            break

        END

        Odoo Read Field    model    id    field    dbname    host    user    pwd    lang    context
    END
